    "type": "tool_prepared",
    "payload": {
      "arguments": {
        "content": "# Product comparison\n\n## Summary table\n\n| Product | Price | Project limit | Retention | Export |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| Atlas | 120 USD | 40 projects | 7 days | CSV |\n| Birch | 180 USD | 75 projects | 14 days | JSON |\n| Cedar | 240 USD | 90 projects | 30 days | XML |\n\n## Recommendation\n\n**Best overall value: Birch.** It is more expensive than Atlas, but it roughly doubles the project limit and retention while offering a more flexible middle ground than Cedar. Cedar has the highest limits and longest retention, but at the highest price. Atlas is the cheapest, but also the most limited.\n\n## Citations\n\n- Atlas: Price 120 USD; limit 40 projects; retention 7 days; export CSV. [source](http://127.0.0.1:59302/atlas)\n- Birch: Price 180 USD; limit 75 projects; retention 14 days; export JSON. [source](http://127.0.0.1:59302/birch)\n- Cedar: Price 240 USD; limit 90 projects; retention 30 days; export XML. [source](http://127.0.0.1:59302/cedar)\n",
        "media_type": "text/markdown",
        "name": "report.md"
